# Safe Agent Kit

Read TEAM_CHARTER.md first.

Hard rules:
- DRY_RUN by default. Never flip to live.
- Nothing irreversible without human approval.
- Secrets: report path + type only.
- Rule files are immutable for agents.
- End every task with the standard report.

